From: coenttb <coen@coenttb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:40:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] exported import, architecture import boundary: re-exports
 moved into the target's root exports.swift (re-export set unchanged;
 type-check follows; Linux x86_64, Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 Sources/URI Standard/URIType.swift | 4 ++--
 Sources/URI Standard/exports.swift | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Sources/URI Standard/exports.swift

diff --git a/Sources/URI Standard/URIType.swift b/Sources/URI Standard/URIType.swift
index 3c175d2..98dd3a1 100644
--- a/Sources/URI Standard/URIType.swift	
+++ b/Sources/URI Standard/URIType.swift	
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
-@_exported public import RFC_3986
-@_exported public import RFC_3987
+public import RFC_3986
+public import RFC_3987
 
 public typealias URI = RFC_3986.URI
 
diff --git a/Sources/URI Standard/exports.swift b/Sources/URI Standard/exports.swift
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..59103f9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Sources/URI Standard/exports.swift	
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+@_exported public import RFC_3986
+@_exported public import RFC_3987
-- 
